    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0078",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-05040-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Without my wife asking these questions, I would not have thought about the Klint exhibition, let alone remembered her paintings.",
      "sentenceSha256": "10957fca0956f0d065d2c4eb7c07851ecbf6df49ada9164afbab742fd99b3283",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "e38e1fbf4eb9fbed21ae1c0bfe5d72e6b1a0dce60227e5bcb6d3f7cc20f765c9",
      "passageSha256": "f53efb4e973b12aee8688900f594bbc3bad057e472b4c7db3b6e46b699078a6a",
      "pdfPages": [
        141
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0079",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-05040-s005",
      "sentenceText": "If you have a captive audience, you are much more likely to tell them what happened each day.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9abdf9eacbf7e3923de89fc53f1ceba070d905e3ae06c7cec4b2382c37aca7a5",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-05040-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "a788d6e595fb9389f18342fa6eabd005f4ba7c040613714b3902b817ca00064d",
      "passageSha256": "022c9241f5b4433e13c11ecafd8430c2d2c4bb9e1b4bf234c708887134ff79f2",
      "pdfPages": [
        141
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0080",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For example, Sixo, a character in Toni Morrison’s Beloved, explains why he walks thirty miles to meet his woman: “She is a friend of my mind.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b23b3fa6b04879cd44a16164d02b738ee3aff68656424946d1a365e218aa350",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "892ad3669e7f1f97f6a5062b3c69b7e9aec17e19cd7c9c99cf4e4900a80f9870",
      "passageSha256": "4fba7c5d6c6a6f485c5854db0c50acdeb2d18c139e0f0882fecff05a5c5902fb",
      "pdfPages": [
        141,
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0081",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-s003",
      "sentenceText": "She gather me, man.",
      "sentenceSha256": "aee00028a950fc2a5a876da76985d07a539edef7e69fb9ef72056df86b2939ec",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "892ad3669e7f1f97f6a5062b3c69b7e9aec17e19cd7c9c99cf4e4900a80f9870",
      "passageSha256": "4fba7c5d6c6a6f485c5854db0c50acdeb2d18c139e0f0882fecff05a5c5902fb",
      "pdfPages": [
        141,
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0082",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-s005",
      "sentenceText": "It’s good, you know, when you got a woman who is a friend of your mind.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "218fcc45de8671fdc9de4372b31b7726929480b8e8843261739d43593dc0e163",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "3659ad7ea122478996f43917e469e1f8a9977bf89214d5afdf5c4ddb6c80b9d7",
      "passageSha256": "ed25cd4a9dffbb9c86784414ff47019103b5b0dfd58ab4045732333e6b22ccbc",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-s006",
      "sentenceText": "A good therapist can also help put confusing pieces together.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bfdf8f40b21d817b47a1ca5a37cc361b7b0f4a94e0c41ecba08c75316d92a845",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p141-06600-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "3659ad7ea122478996f43917e469e1f8a9977bf89214d5afdf5c4ddb6c80b9d7",
      "passageSha256": "ed25cd4a9dffbb9c86784414ff47019103b5b0dfd58ab4045732333e6b22ccbc",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Some of you might not like company.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e2778e30b4baf56e9a5fbbd476fd9ae23c99dad6fb2760373e441426dff2deb4",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-060",
      "parentFingerprint": "ccf26092cea78264c8032d428e0eba1f87cec8c45f46f153978702bbf038f6a7",
      "passageSha256": "610541f2cd45e55c6bde9a3437883f85d92daf41380ffe068fd3712c431f4aff",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s002",
      "sentenceText": "After all, some people are like Daniel Plainview (played by Daniel Day Lewis) in the movie There Will Be Blood, who says, “I see the worst in people…I want to earn enough money, so I can get away from everyone.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "8fa77c6f5c764d10a16b909fdac18aaf5e27c498d6102cdf8602ec28ca55f27b",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-060",
      "parentFingerprint": "ccf26092cea78264c8032d428e0eba1f87cec8c45f46f153978702bbf038f6a7",
      "passageSha256": "610541f2cd45e55c6bde9a3437883f85d92daf41380ffe068fd3712c431f4aff",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0086",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Ernest Hemingway spent his twenties in Paris and kept detailed journals.",
      "sentenceSha256": "09c32df2f9269e5e08dda6edb9779346fff7b3483e01849b2fa3125356fdcb36",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-060",
      "parentFingerprint": "ccf26092cea78264c8032d428e0eba1f87cec8c45f46f153978702bbf038f6a7",
      "passageSha256": "610541f2cd45e55c6bde9a3437883f85d92daf41380ffe068fd3712c431f4aff",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0087",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s007",
      "sentenceText": "So Hemingway went to the basement, retrieved his trunk, and, in it, discovered his journals from the 1920s.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9035a0be805a18f271f568f495078559e4b9c21b08637126d9587e2f191304c4",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "af66d0919646afcef69a9ccbcecfdf52a6ca4ea2859139b122fbab705387a4f3",
      "passageSha256": "49f800b86b319aabcf07e0574a9584e595046ebe7fd2b3beaadfb99c9435a141",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0088",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Under the title, he wrote, “If you are lucky enough to have lived in Paris as a young man, then wherever you go for the rest of your life, it stays with you, for Paris is a moveable feast.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "71d0c09c137b30c7ffb660e1e469c280fc84d1ab5fd0ca8dfe6f78b81f697eba",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "fc9c56bd37c9a2584d2fd0bc49c0e645dbf5c092a5f2714d72bc6c22efb4c8c1",
      "passageSha256": "655320dffadc4402ea0b448071d1ce5d60bcb9b15765603a87532c8245f0348b",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0089",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Hemingway had so many extraordinary life experiences, ranging from World War I to World War II to the Spanish Civil War.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a695632f76331f10aa8b44ab1b6cab92a38e2c25d300083daea61e7e409ab9de",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "fc9c56bd37c9a2584d2fd0bc49c0e645dbf5c092a5f2714d72bc6c22efb4c8c1",
      "passageSha256": "655320dffadc4402ea0b448071d1ce5d60bcb9b15765603a87532c8245f0348b",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0090",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-s012",
      "sentenceText": "As a result, Hemingway collected many moveable feasts.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e1389de764dc3bbd992d8d38c8eeb9c771f4325cfd891dba9b8eb431b070097d",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-01920-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "fc9c56bd37c9a2584d2fd0bc49c0e645dbf5c092a5f2714d72bc6c22efb4c8c1",
      "passageSha256": "655320dffadc4402ea0b448071d1ce5d60bcb9b15765603a87532c8245f0348b",
      "pdfPages": [
        142
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0091",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-05430-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I was too lazy to do this myself, but diaries and journals are building blocks of your future psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "94d36011d37bf0d91d2b54291db8476aa0a90007f6729817f6ba8e538c43c9a3",
